Hi Dick,

16 & 64 are the two configs supported on the AXP150.  So, if you've already 
got 32, you'll need to take 16 out and add 64 for a net of 80.

I've bought some memory (not for an Alpha, but other PC's) from Insight 
(http://www.insight.com) for as little as $11 per MByte recently.  Talk
about a great deal!!!

Plus, you'll have 4 4MB SIMMs left over for some other machines, too...

Good luck,
Aaron

