We are phasing out our Pathworks server (VAX 7610) but I have had to
maintain some duplicate shares for awhile as well.  The only way I found
around this (that is not having the Pathworks machine in the same
domain) was to use duplicate accounts for users (they had both a
Pathworks domain and a NT domain account).  As long as the passwords
stay synched then they can connect to the Pathworks services under the
proper account.  They will have to specify the share name path directly
to connect, it will not show up under a browse list.

