You might try removing the server in question from the domain via the
Server Manager applet. It sounds to me as if the computer doesn't have the
correct SAM as you referenced. You can add it back to the domain the same
way. If the server was set up as a BDC, when you add it to the domain it
will dload the security from the PDC. If it was set up as a server you
will have to reinstall and make it a BDC.

