DEC's ZLXp-L1 is indeed basically the same card, as we designed it
for DEC and supply their NT drivers (though they manufacture it 
themselves, along with the -L2 which is 32MB.)  Drivers are 
continuously updated, especially to support software like 
SoftImage, and DEC's Q/A & manufacturing cycles are probably a
bit long, which is probably why the ones pre-installed were out 
of date already.

